WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.350
Mao.

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:39.360
Sorry.

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:44.670
The scapegoat Chef Xie

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:45.840
was finally released

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:47.790
after revealing the conspiracy of Lord Romen

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:48.750
who feathered his nest

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:50.870
by manipulating the robbers

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.050
pretending to be the acrobatic troupe.

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:59.130
I was almost beheaded.

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:01.200
So few condolences.

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.160
But isn't it great?

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:05.880
We were penniless before.

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:07.230
Mao.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:09.150
What's wrong, Silang?

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:10.370
What's wrong?

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:12.730
I found it.

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:14.710
I found the map of the third cookware.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:15.380
What?

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:22.090
Demogorgon! Miracle of Demon Saint Bronze.

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:25.750
I found it among

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.320
those robbed by thieves.

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:30.790
Look, isn't this similar to the map

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:31.780
given to us by Master Luo Wu?

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:32.880
Great.

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:40.740
Jiuhua.

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:42.700
Map of Mount Jiuhua.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:44.110
If it's Mount Jiuhua,

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:45.980
it's far away in sight.

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:48.340
The third cookware is there.

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.580
Great!

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:51.350
Those of Dark Cooking Society

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.430
can't stop us.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.080
What a great merit, Silang.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.210
Let's go now.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:02:59.160
Okay, let's go.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:20.130
But why this?

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:22.130
We are about to climb.

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:23.690
Only a bowl of ramen.

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:25.560
So poor.

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:27.220
Don't be so extravagant.

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.190
Our travel expenses are limited.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:31.050
That's good.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.890
Just use chicken to make a tasty soup.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:38.390
You put pettitoes, right?

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:39.520
Yes.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:40.910
So delicious.

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.840
Nice ramen!

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:43.810
I am flattered.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:46.300
The soup is mixed with

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:49.290
shrimp, scallops

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.050
and red pepper.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:53.730
The soup is normal.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.140
His evaluation is too much.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:56.930
He must be talking nonsense.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:57.880
It must be nonsense.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.230
It's the first time

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:02.770
I have eaten such delicious ramen.

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:03.940
Thank you so much.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:04.900
Welcome again.

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:08.740
He is such a weird guy.

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:10.980
There are many weird people in this world.

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:11.710
Let's go.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:13.240
We should almost leave.

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:14.750
I am so full.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.720
So full and satisfied.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:19.400
Wait.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.080
You paid one less person.

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:26.260
But I did pay five people.

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:26.960
What's wrong?

00:04:27.270 --> 00:04:29.420
The person who left

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:31.670
said that you will pay his bills.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.560
He went so far!

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.600
I earned a meal.

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:40.470
With these,

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.370
I can make a big deal again.

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:50.650
That is Mount Jiuhua.

00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:52.570
It's where the legendary cookware

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.150
might be.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:56.040
At first glance, it is full of mountains.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:58.800
They opened up a mountainous land.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.390
Jiuhua people are really amazing.

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:02.430
Yes.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:03.590
I heard that the people here

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:05.510
are very hardworking.

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:07.130
People in Sichuan

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:08.700
where I was born admire them.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:23.440
Mao.

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:24.690
Didn't you say that Jiuhua people

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:26.570
are very hardworking?

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.610
It should be like this.

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:30.980
What is going on?

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:32.110
Why are people here

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.970
lazy in the daytime?

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.600
I don't know why either.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:37.420
Forget it.

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.100
Let's inquire about the map first.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:40.500
Excuse me.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:41.560
We want to go to

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:42.950
this place on the map.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:44.950
I really want to eat.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:50.290
I really want to eat that.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.620
I really want to eat.

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.980
Feed me.

00:05:59.180 --> 00:05:59.620
It seems that now

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.330
isn't the time to find cookware.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.040
I really want to eat.

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:05.370
What's that?

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:11.070
Time is up.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.550
It's time for that.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.880
Hey, it's time for what?

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:16.780
Let's go to the Demon Temple.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:18.650
God's cooking is coming out.

00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:22.580
What happened?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.840
God is about to descend again.

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:29.650
What happened indeed?

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.130
They were all lazy just now.

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:32.960
What happened to them?

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:35.240
Let's follow them and have a look.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:36.030
Okay.

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:44.060
So terrible.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:45.920
Why?

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:47.000
Upon hearing the bell,

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:47.610
all the villagers

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:48.610
gathered here.

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:49.500
How could there be such a

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:53.770
gorgeous building in the mountains?

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:56.530
All of them are carrying plates and gold.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:57.830
The line is so long.

00:06:57.880 --> 00:06:59.050
It's weird.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.540
It's incredible.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.490
What will happen?

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:04.590
Hey.

00:07:05.010 --> 00:07:06.600
Why is everyone holding gold?

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:07.890
Why?

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.620
This is a tribute to the God.

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:11.660
The more you give,

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:14.200
the more God's soup you will get.

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:16.880
God's soup?

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:18.690
What God?

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:23.930
Be quiet.

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:32.120
Give me God's soup.

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:33.930
The true color of God will be revealed.

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:53.340
Amazing.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:54.910
So huge.

00:07:57.770 --> 00:08:00.290
Hand over the tribute in order.

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:01.740
Yes.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:06.540
Okay.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:07.910
The next one.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:18.600
They are exchanging something of value

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:20.570
for the soup in the huge pot.

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:22.040
Look.

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:24.480
Everyone is so intoxicated.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.340
The smell of God.

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:30.240
God descends to the world today.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.970
What soup is that?

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:34.710
Mao.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:35.860
Is this the same as

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.300
the red porridge last time?

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:38.890
Lend me the money.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:40.080
Hold on.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:45.120
Please give me five bowls.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.200
Where is your tribute?

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:46.970
Okay.

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:49.380
He handed over

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:50.380
all our money.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:53.930
Okay, five bowls of God's soup.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:56.690
What is in Mao's mind?

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:57.890
He exchanged all the travel expenses

00:08:57.940 --> 00:09:00.350
for five bowls of strange soup.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:02.800
Yes, he should keep at least a half.

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:04.840
How could he be like this?

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.220
If you want to be his wife,

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:10.150
you need to care more about expenses.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.830
Hard work for you, Sister.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:13.480
Yes, I am already...

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.330
Hold on, who is his...?

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:17.270
You fool!

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:21.530
It turned out to be abalone soup.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.510
These abalones are dry and thin.

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:24.510
And there is nothing else

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:25.690
in this soup.

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:27.280
The soup doesn't seem to be

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.730
triggered rich essence.

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:32.320
What is the appeal of this soup?

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:50.940
This...

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:52.330
Mao.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.280
Why are you standing still, Mao?

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.310
What happened to you?

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:02.280
Mao.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.710
It's amazing.

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:06.680
I am speechless.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:10.590
The sweet soup

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:11.660
surrounds the tongue.

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:14.160
The abalone is crispy and sweet,

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:17.010
as if it is about to melt in the mouth.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.960
It takes a lot of efforts and time

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.070
to deal with the abalone.

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:23.450
So great.

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:29.480
This taste...

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:31.270
(Delicious)
This is so delicious

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:33.490
(Delicious)
that it is addictive.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:34.820
After eating this,

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:36.290
I'm afraid I can't eat anything else.

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:37.220
Mao.

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:39.610
Right.

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:40.910
There is an incomparable

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:42.510
profound mystery as if absorbed

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.660
sun and the moon essence.

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.590
No, I can't analyze it.

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:51.090
Could it be...?

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:53.950
Are you talking about...?

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:57.910
Anyone uses a legendary cookware

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.000
in the Demon Temple?

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:02.140
Is there such a great chef

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:03.720
in the mountains?

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:05.590
You mean the seal of the third cookware

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.920
has long been unlocked?

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:09.590
No way. It's incredible.

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:14.730
Be quiet.

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:20.380
Demogorgon is about to show up.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.560
Kneel down to welcome.

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:27.350
Mao, he's coming out.

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:28.750
What kind of chef would it be?

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:54.960
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.970
Demogorgon descends.

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:21.280
Isn't that the one of ramen shop?

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:27.340
Answer me.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:28.550
Who is the God protecting you?

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:33.040
The great Abalone God.

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:34.130
Abalone God?

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:35.770
What's that?

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:38.160
Where do you belong in this life?

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:41.490
Holy Land Demon Temple.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:44.550
Right.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:46.700
There is no place

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:47.880
where the humble and lowly people

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.210
can belong to

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:51.200
except God's arms.

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:54.750
He brazenly said that

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:56.500
he is a God.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:57.860
Indeed.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:58.750
You are just

00:12:58.800 --> 00:12:59.790
a scammer who can't even

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:02.060
taste the ramen.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:03.580
Pay us back soon.

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:06.970
You ate and ran, letting us pay.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:08.620
They are not afraid of

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:09.830
being condemned by God

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:12.520
and don't believe in my miracle.

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:14.030
Never mind.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:22.750
Such a fool.

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:25.860
Never mind.

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:27.970
I will show the power of God

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:30.410
in front of everyone today.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:31.440
Give it to me.

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:32.340
Yes.

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:42.140
What's that?

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:50.140
I will show you.

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:53.220
This is the relic that can show miracles,

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:04.090
Demon Saint Bronze.

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:06.010
(Demon Saint Bronze)

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:08.820
This is a magical bronze

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.060
that only I am qualified to use.

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:13.080
Could it be...?

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:14.590
Exactly.

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:17.400
Take a closer look at the miracle of God.

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:23.290
This abalone was just bought today,

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.390
nothing special.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:26.300
Generally speaking,

00:14:26.350 --> 00:14:28.220
it must be carefully cooked

00:14:28.270 --> 00:14:29.440
for three days and three nights

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:30.780
to restore

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:32.190
its softness.

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:35.900
But with my supernatural power...

00:14:58.990 --> 00:14:59.970
This!

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:05.400
Look!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.220
The gloss and elasticity.

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:13.240
The abalone has been soaked.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.200
This is a miracle of God.

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:17.100
Demogorgon.

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:18.210
How come?

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:20.500
He's right.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:22.790
It takes three days to soak the abalone.

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:25.560
That power is a legendary cookware.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:29.880
You are so naive, master.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.500
I saw through

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:33.790
his deceptive tactic.

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.940
What's going on?

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:37.860
This is quite easy.

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:39.850
That pot is double-layered.

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:41.200
Double-layered?

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:42.530
Yes.

00:15:42.980 --> 00:15:44.160
The bottom layer

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.910
is prepared with soaked abalone.

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:46.550
He just

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.780
took out the abalone from there.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.300
What about that light?

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:51.480
The light should be from

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:53.150
luminous mushrooms.

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:54.670
He must have placed luminous mushrooms

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:55.480
from Mount Jiuhua

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:57.960
on the bottom layer of the pot.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:16:00.310
The top plate should be rotating.

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:02.510
It can be restored immediately.

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:06.090
He just used the rare abalone

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:07.240
and the trick of God descending

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.670
to deceive the people here.

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:11.660
Think about it.

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:14.160
Legendary cookware

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.170
choose the people who use it.

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:17.540
How could it let him deceive others?

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.660
I see.

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:20.660
When did you become so smart?

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:24.130
What are you doing, Chef Xie?

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:25.580
Something's wrong.

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:27.960
How to explain the taste

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:28.860
that makes us speechless?

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:31.750
Demogorgon.

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:33.730
I rummaged through the whole house

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:36.100
and finally found little gold.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.470
Could you give some abalone to my kids?

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:47.370
Mother.

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:49.130
If you have no tribute,

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:51.810
bring the title-deeds of the house.

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:52.990
You humble people

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:56.060
cannot live without my charity.

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:58.210
Please do us a favor.

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:02.840
That being the case,

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:04.160
this one is for you.

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:09.960
This guy

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:10.940
went too far.

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:12.410
Unforgivable.

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.590
No matter how good his craft is,

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:15.970
he is so indifferent

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:17.180
to the misfortunes of others.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:19.650
He is not worthy to be a chef.

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:21.570
What's wrong?

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:24.060
Just take it.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:25.560
Stop.

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:29.080
Don't be deceived.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.360
He's not a God.

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:32.880
He is just a heartless

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:33.980
scum chef.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:37.350
What? Who are you?

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:38.920
Listen carefully.

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:42.330
He is the youngest super chef in history

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.100
(Super)
Liu Maoxing.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:51.380
Super chef?

00:17:51.430 --> 00:17:52.460
He's nothing.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.100
I am Demogorgon

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:55.760
sent by heaven.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:59.050
Could a super chef trigger miracles?

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:00.270
Shut up.

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:02.630
I saw through your deceptive tricks.

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:03.420
Right.

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:04.900
Freeze!

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.200
What do you want to do?

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:13.530
Look carefully.

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:16.040
This pot has double layers.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:25.820
Why aren't there double layers?

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:27.340
Well.

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:29.170
Could he really be...?

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:32.070
You fools.

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:33.700
Do you understand now?

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:34.890
People of Jiuhua.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:36.160
They insulted the hometown Demon Temple

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.250
in favor with the general public and

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:40.260
doubted the miracle of God.

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:41.720
Kick them out.

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:45.510
Mao.

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:46.170
Gosh.

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:48.690
Chef Xie.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:51.830
Kick them out.

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:56.550
God's Bronze.

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.610
Please hold on.

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:00.300
This won't work.

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:01.160
Let's run away.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:03.810
Stop it.

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:04.620
Stop it.

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:13.240
Who is he indeed?

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:14.210
Master.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.650
Such a peaceful and beautiful village

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:17.690
is likely to be

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.190
destroyed by that scum.

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:22.180
But he incited so many people and

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.310
the title of Super Chef

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:25.910
doesn't work here.

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:28.450
I will never give up.

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:29.830
I will definitely find a way

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:31.760
to punish that liar.

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.500
Everyone here has changed.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:40.140
Everyone used to come here to pray.

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:41.920
They lead a hard life.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:43.980
Jiuhua is actually

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:45.940
a holy land.

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:50.910
It is said that this place was developed

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:53.220
by a comet that fell from the sky

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:54.670
a thousand years ago.

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:57.880
The crops here

00:19:57.930 --> 00:19:58.730
are harvested every year.

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:00.590
Therefore, the people of Jiuhua

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:03.820
used to admire Comet God very much.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:13.790
Comet?

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:18.860
Uncle, is the legend true?

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:21.000
Can you elaborate more?

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:22.320
What happened to you, Mao?

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:24.670
What he said just now

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.730
may contain clues to solving the problem.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.220
The people here are so stupid.

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:36.490
I didn't expect it to go so smoothly.

00:20:37.770 --> 00:20:38.390
With these,

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:39.240
I can enjoy

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:40.340
a happy life.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:45.000
Your Highness.

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:45.590
It's almost time.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.370
I got it.

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:49.360
It's time to give alms again.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.980
Today I will fool

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:55.520
those stupid people.

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:03.020
Who is the God protecting you?

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:07.460
The great Abalone God.

00:21:07.510 --> 00:21:09.430
Where do you belong in this life?

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:12.740
Holy Land Demon Temple.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:15.500
That's right.

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:17.810
Exactly, you fools.

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:19.140
You are wrong.

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:20.460
You are fake.

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:24.630
If you can't bring happiness to people,

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:25.750
how can you be qualified as a God?

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.220
I will now unmask your hypocrisy

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:30.300
in front of everyone.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:31.490
Who's that?

00:21:38.470 --> 00:21:41.480
I am the Comet God

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:43.760
who befell to Jiuhua

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:45.520
a thousand years ago.

00:23:14.934 --> 00:23:16.936
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.780 --> 00:23:19.986
Okay, if you're the Abalone Deity,

00:23:19.986 --> 00:23:21.548
I'll challenge by playing the Comet Deity.

00:23:21.938 --> 00:23:25.764
Behold! The miracle of a thousand years ago,
Miracle Comet Fried Rice,

00:23:25.982 --> 00:23:26.639
descends!

00:23:27.272 --> 00:23:28.601
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:30.269
Shooting Star of Heaven!

00:23:30.269 --> 00:23:32.032
Special Comet Fried Rice

00:23:32.266 --> 00:23:33.553
It will definitely be interesting!
